{"asset_key":"ep1/herohub_story_11412150","episode":"ep1","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"11412150","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1141215001:1":{"text":"ちょっとちょっと、あっしの水筒を持っていかないでください。そこには市場で汲んできた、一切砂が混じってない美味しい水が入ってるんですよ。","source_cn":"等一下，你不能拿走我的水壶，那里面可是我从集市淘换来的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2B24C694B06BE738","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1141215002:1":{"text":"……本当ですか！？どうりで美味しいと思いました！","source_cn":"……真的吗！怪不得喝起来特别好喝！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBD68A6FACF6E8253","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1141215003:1":{"text":"なんでも信じるなよ。こいつの言うことを信じるくらいなら、鹹水町がオアシスに変わるってことを信じたほうがいいぜ。","source_cn":"别什么都信，信他的嘴还不如信咸水镇会变成绿洲。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x696C8889749946B8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1141215004:1":{"text":"前に占ってみたんだけど、鹹水町が本当にオアシスになるのはおよそ三百七十二年後だよ！","source_cn":"咸水镇真的会变成绿洲，我占卜过了，大约在372年之后！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x88296955147D5AD7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:阿德":{"text":"アド","source":"阿德","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"ロンロン","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:瓦尔克":{"text":"ウォルク","source":"瓦尔克","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:萨忒娜